# ScholarX Backend Rules

- Framework: FastAPI (Python 3.12, port 8000)
- Orchestration: LangGraph 10-node StateGraph (`backend/graph/builder.py`)
- Database: `aiosqlite` with WAL mode (`data/scholarx_sessions.db`)
- LLM SDK: Groq primary (`qwen/qwen3.8-27b`) + Google Gemini fallback (`from google import genai`). NEVER import legacy `google.generativeai`.
- Events: Emit real-time telemetry via `backend/events/bus.py` with typed `ScholarXEvent` models.
- Tests: Always write tests in `backend/tests/test_*.py` using pytest and pytest-asyncio.
- Fast Test Command: `.venv/bin/pytest backend/tests/test_schemas.py backend/tests/test_api_keys.py -v`
- Documentation: Read `.context/02_BACKEND_LANGGRAPH.md` and `.context/05_API_SSE_EVENTS.md`.
